<title>USA: ANB Corp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>ANB Corp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MUNCIE, Ind. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.30		    $0.26</p>
<p> Net			  1,372		    1,184</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.33		    $1.16</p>
<p> Net			  6,006		    5,285</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Per share data reflects a two-for-one stock split distributed in December 1995.</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 net income includes charge of $356,000 for recapitalizing the Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
<p>Total assets = $494 million versus $483 million.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
